{"message":"You’re right—**Dark Green Account is not the supported business-checking referral option**. I need to correct my earlier answer.

For this LLC and an approximately **$31,000** deposit, use the exact account name **World Blue** (also described as World Blue International Checking). Its business referral requires at least **$25,000 deposited within 90 days**, and the referrer bonus is **$300**. You must have maintained a Rho-Bank checking relationship for at least **90 days**.

The $31,000 funding would not meet the $50,000 requirement for True Blue. Only one referral code can be applied, and the referral cannot be combined with another new-account promotion."}
